    "verdict_notes": "Row values match Table 2. The Counting text gives different Mixed accuracies (50.0%, 50.5%, 40.0%) than Table 2 (44.2%, 43.4%, 35.5%), an internal inconsistency in the paper. Results are single-seed with a fixed step budget, so dataset size is confounded with updates per example."
